  "notes": "USAGE:\n{変異|へんい} is primarily used in scientific and medical contexts, particularly in biology and genetics. It became widely known during discussions of viral mutations. As a ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb, it describes the process of mutating.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{遺伝子|いでんし}→遺伝子：05031_idenshi⟧{変異|へんい}: genetic mutation\n- {変異|へんい}⟦{株|かぶ}→株：02592_kabu⟧: mutant strain, variant\n- ⟦{突然変異|とつぜんへんい}→突然変異：19099_totsuzenheni⟧: sudden mutation\n- {変異|へんい}⟦{体|たい}→体：09872_tai⟧: mutant (organism)",
